<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>

<config xmlns="http://thelia.net/schema/dic/config"
        xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
        xsi:schemaLocation="http://thelia.net/schema/dic/config http://thelia.net/schema/dic/config/thelia-1.0.xsd">

    <!-- Nothing to declare here: in Thelia 3 loops, forms and hooks are discovered from the
         services registered by Keyword::configureServices().

         - Loops keep their historical names, which the auto-discovery derives from the class
           short name (Keyword\Loop\KeywordContent -> keyword_content).
         - Forms keep the names returned by their own getName(). The former <forms> aliases
           (keyword_admin_*) only existed for the removed Smarty back-office templates.
         - Hooks are registered by Keyword\Hook\TwigBackHook::getSubscribedHooks(). The old XML
           declaration instantiated BackHookManager without autowiring: its container was never
           initialized, which made every fragment of the hook silently disappear. -->
</config>
